msgid "short"
msgstr "A short translation that fits on a single line."

msgid "ascii"
msgstr "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris."

msgid "exact-fit"
msgstr "This translation is padded so that the whole line is just about 79 cols"

msgid "newlines"
msgstr "First line of a multi-line message.\nSecond line, which is a bit longer than the first one and therefore needs to be wrapped by the compiler.\nThird line.\n"

msgid "escapes"
msgstr "Press \"Save\" to store C:\\Users\\name\\Documents\\file.txt, or press\t\"Cancel\" to discard all of the changes made so far."

msgid "url"
msgstr "See https://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/manual/html_node/PO-Files.html#PO-Files-for-more-information-about-the-format."

msgid "punctuation"
msgstr "Values (one/two/three), [four|five] and {six-seven-eight} -- plus 100% of $5.00 -- should break at sensible places..."

msgid "html"
msgstr "<b><em class=\"placeholder\">@count</em> Members</b> are selected, <a href=\"/admin/people\">manage them</a> here."

msgid "latin"
msgstr "Ça été une très belle journée à Zürich, où les émigrés ont dégusté des crêpes, des smørrebrød et des Käsespätzle."

msgid "combining"
msgstr "Decomposed accents such as é should not count as extra width: résumé café naïve résumé café naïve."

msgid "cjk-ja"
msgstr "これは日本語のテキストです。全角文字は半角文字の二倍の幅を持つため、行の折り返し位置が変わります。句読点の前では改行しないでください。"

msgid "cjk-zh"
msgstr "这是一段中文文本，用于测试换行算法。中文字符占用两个字符宽度，因此每行能容纳的字符数量大约是英文的一半左右。"

msgid "cjk-ko"
msgstr "이것은 한국어 텍스트입니다. 한글 음절은 전각 문자로 표시되며 줄 바꿈 위치를 결정할 때 너비가 두 배로 계산되어야 합니다."

msgid "mixed"
msgstr "Mixed content: English text, 日本語のテキスト, 中文文本 and some emoji 😀🎉👍 combined in one long message string."

msgid "emoji"
msgstr "😀😃😄😁😆😅😂🤣😊😇🙂🙃😉😌😍🥰😘😗😙😚😋😛😝😜🤪🤨🧐🤓😎🥸🤩🥳😏😒😞😔😟😕🙁"

msgid "no-breaks"
msgstr "Averyveryverylongwordwithoutanyspacesoranypunctuationthatcannotbebrokenanywhereatallreally"

msgid "singular"
msgid_plural "<b><em class=\"placeholder\">@count</em> Members</b> are selected"
msgstr[0] "One member is selected, and this sentence is long enough to be wrapped by the compiler."
msgstr[1] "Several members are selected, and this sentence is long enough to be wrapped as well."

msgid "A long msgid that is also wrapped by the compiler because it does not fit within the page width."
msgstr "Een lange msgid die ook door de compiler wordt afgebroken omdat hij niet binnen de paginabreedte past."

# Examples from https://github.com/smhg/gettext-parser/issues/51
msgid "issue-51-books"
msgstr "<em>Books</em> have a built-in hierarchical navigation. Use for handbooks or tutorials."

msgid "issue-51-branding"
msgstr "Open Social Branding will be replaced by site name (and slogan if available). Upload a logo below."

msgid "issue-51-mention"
msgstr "You were mentioned in a post by <a href=\"\">[social_mentions:mentioned_user]</a> in the community."

msgctxt "a fairly long context string that explains where this message is used in the application"
msgid "context"
msgstr "A translation with a long context, which also needs to be wrapped across several lines."

